{"chars": "And who lives in those cottages? The elves! North Pole elves are about as tall as a kitchen table, with pointed ears, rosy cheeks and quick, clever fingers. But no two elves look alike. Long ago, elves came to the North Pole from every corner of the world, so their skin is every shade you can imagine, and their hair is straight or wavy, curly or coily, black or brown or red or golden or silver. Some are young and bouncy, and some are very, very old. And all of them call the North Pole home. They wear knitted caps in every color of the rainbow, each one with a tiny bell on the tip, so wherever elves go, you hear them coming: jingle, jingle, jingle. They hum while they work, they sing while they walk, and they laugh at almost everything.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.738, 0.738, 0.738, 0.825, 0.825, 0.825, 0.825, 0.825, 0.825, 1.05, 1.05, 1.05, 1.05, 1.05, 1.05, 1.05, 1.05, 1.05, 1.875, 1.975, 1.975, 1.975, 1.975, 2.138, 2.138, 2.138, 2.138, 2.138, 2.138, 2.85, 2.95, 2.95, 2.95, 2.95, 2.95, 2.95, 3.2, 3.2, 3.2, 3.2, 3.2, 3.5, 3.5, 3.5, 3.5, 3.5, 3.5, 3.763, 3.763, 3.763, 3.763, 3.837, 3.837, 3.837, 3.837, 3.837, 3.837, 4.088, 4.088, 4.088, 4.225, 4.225, 4.225, 4.225, 4.225, 4.487, 4.487, 4.487, 4.588, 4.588, 4.65, 4.65, 4.65, 4.65, 4.65, 4.65, 4.65, 4.65, 5.0, 5.0, 5.0, 5.0, 5.0, 5.0, 5.6, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 5.85, 5.85, 5.85, 5.85, 5.85, 5.85, 5.85, 5.85, 6.263, 6.263, 6.263, 6.263, 6.263, 6.7, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 7.162, 7.162, 7.162, 7.162, 7.162, 7.162, 7.162, 7.513, 7.513, 7.513, 7.513, 7.625, 7.625, 7.625, 7.625, 7.625, 7.625, 7.875, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 8.262, 8.262, 8.262, 8.262, 8.262, 8.262, 8.262, 8.262, 9.05, 9.125, 9.125, 9.125, 9.125, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.488, 9.488, 9.488, 9.488, 9.7, 9.7, 9.7, 9.7, 9.7, 9.7, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 10.15, 10.15, 10.15, 10.15, 10.15, 10.15, 10.825, 10.925, 10.925, 10.925, 10.925, 1